msgstr "Nano 33 BLE Sense jest dostarczany z:"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:714
msgid "``/flash`` — **64 KB** FAT filesystem, read/write."
msgstr ""
"``/flash`` — system plików FAT o pojemności **64 KB**\\ , do odczytu/zapisu."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:716
msgid ""
"The Nano 33 BLE Sense build does not include a ROMFS; ship Python modules on"
" ``/flash`` directly."
msgstr ""
"Kompilacja Nano 33 BLE Sense nie zawiera ROMFS; dostarczaj moduły Python "
"bezpośrednio na ``/flash``\\ ."

